versations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Introducing Someone  "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you introduce someone at work, you use words like:  <br /> <br />\u201cThis is (name), a new employee \u201d <br />\u201cI'd like to meet (name), our manager.\u201d<br /><br />When you introduce yourself to someone at work, you use words like:<br /><br />\u201cHi, I'm (name) . I work in the (job type) department.\u201d"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I'd like you to meet Alysha. She's starting today.<br />            <span class=\"strong\">Jennifer</span>: Hi Alysha. Let me know if you need anything."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le18ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to evaluate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to judge the performance of an employee"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Every employee should expect the boss to evaluate them once a year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you have a conversation with your boss."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "