": " what you say to introduce a person to another person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa, I'd you to meet our head chef, Daniel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "It's a pleasure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what you say to reply when you are introduced to someone new  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hi. It's a pleasure to meet you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Talk about what your boss told you at the beginning about the rules and your work hours."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph including both introductory and concluding sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Introduce one friend or co-worker to another in English. Teach them what they should say to respond."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about policies at work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph describing the conditions of my job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I introduce one person to another in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I teach someone to respond to a greeting in English."}]}], "type": "sena"}